5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe we should be mindful of the people who make these exhibitions possible. I will look into the composition of the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing and backlog.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I want to see where the actual failures occur. I will examine the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm more interested in what the public actually thinks! I'll dive into the five years of visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts across ten seasons.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I will examine the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to find out where all the money goes! I'll check the loan transport costs over three seasons and the mount-making charges and joiner's rate. This will be like a treasure hunt!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
