11,1,2,pass,Shion,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I think we've all covered the bases quite nicely. I'm just dying to see if the crowds actually enjoyed our ""masterpieces"" or if they were just being polite!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
13,1,2,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We have a comprehensive plan. I will wait for the results of the surveys and bookings.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
