16,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm so excited! I bet I'll find some super secret spending hiding in those costs. Let's see what the numbers tell us!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
