18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely to see such enthusiasm from everyone. I shall wait patiently for our findings to return so we can make a gentle and thoughtful decision together.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
19,1,3,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
