58,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I feel that Candidate A, the Textiles of the Region, is a lovely choice. It uses local treasures, which would be much kinder to our shipping budget and our tired staff.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Candidate A is logically the most stable. It avoids the international shipping delays I found and the mechanical failures of powered displays. It is a low-risk, high-reliability option.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,May,,"A is actually a winner! It has those demonstration sessions and craftspeople, which is exactly the kind of human interaction that keeps people coming back. It's a spark without the stress!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Candidate A is the most practical. Local items avoid the weight limits of the suspended bay, and the nature of textiles is less likely to be damaged by evening hire activities than large reconstructions or rigging.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"A is the best! Since it's local, we won't spend all our money on scary shipping costs, and the craftspeople can bring their own tools. It's like a budget-saving miracle! I vote for A!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shizue,,It is truly wonderful to see us all in such harmony. Candidate A is a gentle path that respects our staff's well-being and our budget. I happily cast my vote for A.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Shion,,"While the others are swept up in the ""charm"" of the local approach, I am simply looking at the risk mitigation. A avoids the shipping cut-off disasters and the mechanical instability of C. I vote for A.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,"I'm not just swept up in the charm, Shion! I'm looking at the data. A gives us the human element and the activity that actually draws a crowd. It's a total win. I vote for A!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I concur. Candidate A is the only option that doesn't threaten the structural integrity of the bay or risk damage during evening events. It is the most sustainable choice for the building. I vote for A.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! Everyone agrees! It's like we all solved the mystery together. No scary shipping bills, no broken plugs, and no crashing floors. A is definitely the winner! I vote for A too!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It is such a joy to see us all agreeing so kindly. I feel a great sense of peace knowing we have chosen a path that will be gentle on everyone involved.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
69,3,3,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
70,3,3,talk,Shion,,"The result is a foregone conclusion. When the data aligns so perfectly across all our concerns, the only logical choice is the one with the fewest points of failure. I am satisfied.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
71,3,3,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,I'm just glad we didn't pick something that would leave the visitors yawning! A little bit of life in the gallery is exactly what we need. I'm out!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
73,3,3,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I am also satisfied. We have found a solution that balances the needs of the visitors, the staff, and the physical constraints of the gallery.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
75,3,3,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
76,3,3,talk,Sakura,,This was so easy! It's like the perfect puzzle piece fitting right into place. I'm going to go celebrate with some snacks!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
